<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Yahoo! started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Yahoo! started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Wednesday analyst Bruce Smith started coverage of Yahoo! Inc with a rating of near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Santa Clara, Calif., Internet navigational services company closed Tuesday at 33-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
